 and 1 was partially new (0.90), plus a 0.10 simplicity bonus for resolving the consumer-count contradiction and closing the eight-file question.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What schema and complete consumer call-site set governs each file type, including advisor, benchmark, doctor, and tests?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What schema and complete consumer call-site set governs each file type, including advisor, benchmark, doctor, and tests?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Treating leaf-manifest.json as authored truth\",\"Treating leaf-aliases.json as redundant with registry/config data\",\"Treating command-metadata.json as a generic fleet-wide advisor input\",\"Counting four direct command-metadata reader files when the current tree contains five\"],\"focusTrack\":\"leaf-command-contracts\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:46-239\",\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/lib/leaf-resource-contract.cjs:51-440\",\".opencode/commands/doctor/scripts/parent-skill-check.cjs:1063-1233\",\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/ci-leaf-manifest-freshness.cjs:1-105\",\".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/skill-benchmark/router-replay.cjs:180-289\",\".opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-improvement/scripts/skill-benchmark/load-playbook-scenarios.cjs:607-658\",\".opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574\",\".openco... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n5: {\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"run\":4,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research; target_agent=@deep-research; execution=single_iteration; state_source=externalized_files; do_not_switch_mode=true\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Derive the consumer-based skill taxonomy and resolve every exceptional presence case.\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"2 of 5 findings were fully new and 3 partially new (0.70), plus a 0.10 simplicity bonus for resolving two open classification questions with one two-class model.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What consumer-derived skill class taxonomy maps all 12 skills and makes each presence difference either required, optional by class, or defective?\",\"How should the five graph-only skills, leaf-aliases.json, command-metadata.json, and sparse sk-git be classified after behavior-impact checks?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What consumer-derived skill class taxonomy maps all 12 skills and makes each presence difference either required, optional by class, or defective?\",\"How should the five graph-only skills, leaf-aliases.json, command-metadata.json, and sparse sk-git be classified after behavior-impact checks?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"A standalone-description class\",\"A legitimate sparse sk-git class\",\"Fleet-wide command metadata based only on command ownership\",\"Generating alias policy from file presence\"],\"focusTrack\":\"skill-class-taxonomy\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"research/lineages/sol-high-fast/iterations/iteration-001.md:15-34\",\"research/lineages/sol-high-fast/iterations/iteration-002.md:12-17\",\"research/lineages/sol-high-fast/iterations/iteration-003.md:13-18\",\".opencode/commands/doctor/scripts/parent-skill-check.cjs:252-321,1020-1074\",\".opencode/skills/system-skill-advisor/mcp-server/lib/skill-graph/skill-graph-db.ts:753-828,946-970,1037-1099\",\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-ski... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n6: {\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":5,\"run\":5,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research; target_agent=@deep-research; execution=single_iteration; state_source=externalized_files; do_not_switch_mode=true\",\"status\":\"c