{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785179893743,"sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_mN5vbZRmRxdLmqx4FFuKAvgk","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research destructive git risks","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Execute exactly ONE deep-research LEAF iteration for the detached lineage. Do not dispatch subagents.\n\nIteration: 2 of 5\nFocus: Investigate destructive history and recovery operations: published amend/rebase, hard reset/clean/restore, branch/worktree deletion, stash/reflog destruction, immediate pruning, and bounded read-only state probes that distinguish real risk from routine use. Validate or reject iteration 1 candidates; broaden beyond the briefing floor.\n\nRead state FIRST:\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deep-research-config.json\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deep-research-strategy.md\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-001.md\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/BRIEFING.md\n\nUse exact local source and bounded Git evidence. Every finding must state: exact operation shape; specific pre-execution state; whether genuinely available before execution; noise measured from real history or explicit not measured; source as named sk-git rule/incident/new with justification; confidence confirmed/inferred. Identify cheap probes, race windows, and advisory candidates that should be eliminated because Git or existing hooks already protect them.\n\nAllowed write paths only:\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-002.md\n- append exactly one canonical iteration record to .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\n\nDo not modify any other path, including strategy/registry/dashboard/config/research.md. Do not stage or commit. Include canonical route proof fields and all required iteration metadata. Return only after verifying all three artifacts."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_05b07a6d2ffepZnFX30LgrbUD8\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 2 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Destructive history/recovery operations and bounded pre-execution probes  \n**Findings**: 10 findings (0 fully new, 10 partially new, 0 redundant)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.60  \n**Questions answered**: Bounded probes for destructive-history advisories  \n**Questions remaining**: 4  \n**Edge cases**: Missing exact invocation telemetry; publication-state ambiguity documented  \n**Recommended next focus**: Staging/commit semantics and hook overlap\n\n**Files written**:\n- `research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-002.md`\n- `research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one record appended\n- `research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-002.jsonl`\n\n**Verification**:\n- All three artifacts exist: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- State/delta records byte-equivalent: yes\n- Required metadata and route proof: yes\n- Ten findings fully cited: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- No staging, commits, or subagents: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","sessionId":"ses_05b07a6d2ffepZnFX30LgrbUD8","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research destructive git risks","time":{"start":1785179167410,"end":1785179893737}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_084af91d4d7cee66016a67ac06dd0481918301622ef75b935c"}},"id":"prt_fa4f7fae9001dwQOoheTIqN76u","sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","messageID":"msg_fa4f7ecb2001HC4W7TPtRq6IL0"}}
