{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785180934516,"sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_ysM8ihKqcqoGvzPm0I4KkdXT","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research remote worktree coordination","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Execute exactly ONE deep-research LEAF iteration for the detached lineage. No subagents.\n\nIteration: 4 of 5\nFocus: Investigate worktree, remote, and account coordination: detached/linked-worktree pushes, primary-checkout reconciliation, launch-wrapper autosync bypass, active `gh` account versus remote owner, force/delete/tag refspecs, push permission enforcement overlap, and exact preflight race/noise boundaries. Go beyond the briefing's detached push and 403 incidents.\n\nRead lineage config/state/strategy/registry, iterations 001-003, and BRIEFING.md first. Use sk-git SKILL and remote/finish/worktree/continuous-integration references, current pre-push hook, exact current worktree/remotes/account state, and bounded history where useful.\n\nEvery finding must include exact operation; specific pre-execution state; whether genuinely available before execution; measured real-history noise or explicit unmeasured; source classification; confirmed/inferred confidence. Distinguish local positive evidence from authorization and remote outcomes that remain unknowable/raceable. Identify advisories that duplicate blocking hooks and should be silent.\n\nAllowed writes only:\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-004.md\n- append one canonical iteration record to .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\n\nDo not edit any other path. Do not stage, commit, fetch, push, or mutate refs. Include canonical route proof and required metadata; verify all three artifacts before returning."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_05af31e78ffe2fu4stGtECdLBS\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 4 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Worktree, remote, account, refspec, enforcement-overlap, and preflight race/noise boundaries  \n**Findings**: 10 findings (5 new, 5 partially new)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.75  \n**Questions answered**: Positive coordination evidence; advisories duplicated by blocking hooks  \n**Questions remaining**: 2  \n**Edge cases**: Contradictory evidence—the tracked pre-push hook owns enforcement, but it is not currently installed  \n**Recommended next focus**: Final candidate matrix, aggregate noise budget, coalescing, and latency limits\n\n**Files written**:\n- `research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-004.md`\n- `research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one record appended\n- `research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-004.jsonl`\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Delta/state canonical record byte-equivalent: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Canonical route metadata present: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- No staging, commit, fetch, push, or ref mutation: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","sessionId":"ses_05af31e78ffe2fu4stGtECdLBS","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Research remote worktree coordination","time":{"start":1785180512880,"end":1785180934511}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08a8a1f2db524d40016a67b158b7b08191be016416aac79972"}},"id":"prt_fa50cc2bb001w3u4972gyBa4QQ","sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","messageID":"msg_fa50cb353001Gh6i8vVBNelSX1"}}
