{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785181547161,"sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_koaYRHxAfaOXHm3tojhae5Y1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Calibrate advisory noise matrix","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto","prompt":"Execute exactly ONE deep-research LEAF iteration for the detached lineage. This is forced iteration 5 of 5 under stopPolicy=max-iterations; prior convergence is telemetry only. No subagents.\n\nFocus: Calibrate the final candidate matrix and noise threshold. Rank every retained candidate from iterations 1-4 by positive-evidence strength, cost, overlap, and available measured prevalence. Define one-line coalescing, probe latency/budget, and aggregate alert-rate targets. Explicitly reject candidates whose exact state predicate is unavailable, whose protection is already enforced, or whose expected noise is too high. Do not merely summarize prior incidents; produce a decision-ready rule set.\n\nRead lineage config/state/strategy/registry, iterations 001-004, all deltas, and BRIEFING.md first. Use exact repository history/state measurements where legitimately possible. If a candidate's option-sensitive fire rate cannot be measured from Git history, state that explicitly rather than inventing a number. Every retained/rejected candidate entry must still satisfy briefing fields: exact operation; pre-state and genuine availability; noise measured or unmeasured; source classification; confirmed/inferred confidence.\n\nAllowed writes only:\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-005.md\n- append one canonical iteration record to .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl\n- .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-005.jsonl\n\nDo not modify any other path. Do not stage, commit, fetch, push, or mutate refs. Include canonical route proof and all required metadata. Verify all three artifacts before returning."},"output":"<task id=\"ses_05aeb7f9effeZsL1fzIJFLtlx0\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 5 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Final candidate ranking, noise thresholds, probe budgets, and coalescing rules  \n**Findings**: 5 findings (2 new, 3 partially new)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 0.80  \n**Decision set**: 23 retained rules; 14 rejected candidate classes  \n**Questions answered**: Final noise calibration and decision-ready rule matrix  \n**Questions remaining**: 0  \n**Edge cases**: Missing normalized PreToolUse telemetry; option-sensitive rates remain explicitly unmeasured  \n**Recommended next focus**: Shadow-mode implementation and telemetry validation\n\n**Files written**:\n- `research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-005.md`\n- `research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl` — appended exactly one iteration record\n- `research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-005.jsonl`\n\n**Verification**:\n- Iteration file exists: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Total iteration records: 5\n- Delta canonical record matches state: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Ranked retained entries: 23\n- Canonical route proof present: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- Sub-agents dispatched: no\n\n**Status**: complete — stopped at forced `max-iterations` policy.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","sessionId":"ses_05aeb7f9effeZsL1fzIJFLtlx0","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Calibrate advisory noise matrix","time":{"start":1785181012259,"end":1785181547144}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_05365dd2115764ca016a67b34c006c819194a31fdaee4bad31"}},"id":"prt_fa51460df001PZW75x3C5Y923s","sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","messageID":"msg_fa514536e001Oi7nL4xt6pn85g"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1785181548287,"sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","part":{"id":"prt_fa51caef9001C7mjVlVscIuYtu","reason":"tool-calls","snapshot":"fe03b20dde9c4dbba7dc0e6f79ecce2c3c838fcc","messageID":"msg_fa514536e001Oi7nL4xt6pn85g","sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":253780,"input":917,"output":447,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"write":0,"read":252416}},"cost":0}}
