validate bounded pre-execution probes\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"newInfoRatio\":0.6,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 10 findings partially validated or narrowed iteration 1 candidates, with a 0.10 simplicity bonus for eliminating routine forms and reducing retained rules to exact state gates.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which repository, worktree, index, remote, config, and account state is genuinely available before each candidate command runs?\",\"Which high-cost failures beyond the five observed incidents warrant new advisory rules?\",\"How often would each candidate fire in real repository history, and what is the defensible noise threshold?\",\"Which dangerous-looking operations should remain silent because enforcement already owns them or preflight state is unavailable or too noisy?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which bounded read-only probes make destructive-history predicates precise enough for an advisory?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Generic warnings for rebase, reset, restore, clean, branch deletion, worktree cleanup, reflog maintenance, or GC\",\"Rebase recovery/control forms and every dry-run form\",\"Ordinary branch -d, checked-out branch deletion, and ordinary dirty worktree removal already protected by Git\",\"Staged-only restore, stash apply, conflicted stash pop, routine worktree prune, default reflog expiry, and routine GC\",\"Treating absent remote-tracking containment as proof that history is unpublished\"],\"focusTrack\":\"destructive-history-recovery\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Skill\",\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".opencode/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md:309-330,482-500\",\".opencode/skills/sk-git/references/shared-patterns.md:156-210\",\".opencode/skills/sk-git/references/finish-workflows.md:258... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n4: {\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research targe