 matrix and noise threshold into a decision-ready rule set\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":0.8,\"noveltyJustification\":\"2 of 5 findings were fully new and 3 partially new, yielding 0.70 plus a 0.10 simplicity bonus for resolving the final open question.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How often would each candidate fire in real repository history, and what is the defensible noise threshold?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How often can retained candidates legitimately be measured from existing history, where should the noise threshold sit, and what final ranked rule set should advance?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Broad Git-family, path-count, and ownership-inference warnings\",\"Predicates requiring post-fetch, post-hook, transport-credential, authorization, or final remote outcome state\",\"Duplicate naming and permission advisories already owned by pre-push enforcement\",\"Network probes, full object scans, and all-worktree sweeps in the synchronous hot path\",\"Generic filter-branch or filter-repo warnings without a validated exact mutating predicate\"],\"focusTrack\":\"noise-calibration-final-matrix\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Skill\",\"Glob\",\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"ApplyPatch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"research/BRIEFING.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/deep-research-config.json\",\"research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl\",\"research/lineages/sol/deep-research-strategy.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-001.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-002.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-003.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-004.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-001.jsonl\",\"research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\",\"research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-003.jso... (line truncated to 2000 chars)","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/s