nd what is the defensible noise threshold?\",\"Which dangerous-looking operations should remain silent because enforcement already owns them or preflight state is unavailable/too noisy?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which direct git operation families can be classified reliably from the Bash command before execution?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Unconditional advisories for generic commit, reset, rebase, pull, or push families\",\"Duplicating existing pre-push branch naming and permission enforcement\",\"Using git log or reflog as exact argv telemetry\",\"Treating raceable remote snapshots or post-execution outcomes as preflight facts\"],\"toolsUsed\":[\"Skill\",\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".opencode/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md\",\".opencode/skills/sk-git/references/commit-workflows.md\",\".opencode/skills/sk-git/references/remote-branch-policy.md\",\".opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/scripts/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.mjs\",\".opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-devin/SKILL.md\",\".opencode/scripts/git-hooks/pre-push\",\".opencode/scripts/git-hooks/p... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":2,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Investigate destructive history and recovery operations and validate bounded pre-execution probes\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"newInfoRatio\":0.6,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 10 findings partially validated or narrowed iteration 1 candidates, with a 0.10 simplicity bonus for eliminating routine forms and reducing retained rules to exact state gates.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which repository, worktree, index, remote, config, and account state is genuinely available before each candidate command runs?\",\"Which high-cost failures beyond the five observed incidents warrant new advisory rules?\",\"How often would each candidate fire in real repository history, and what is the defensible noise threshold?\",\"Which dangerous-looking operations should remain silent because enforcement already owns them or preflight state is unavailable or too noisy?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which bounded read-only probes make destructive-history predicates precise enough for an advisory?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Generic warnings for rebase, reset, restore, clean, branch deletion, worktree cleanup, reflog maintenance, or GC\",\"Rebase recovery/control forms and every dry-run form\",\"Ordinary branch -d, checked-out branch deletion, and ordinary dirty worktree removal already protected by Git\",\"Staged-only restore, stash apply, conflicted stash pop, routine worktree prune, default reflog expiry, and routine GC\",\"Treating absent remote-tracking containment as proof that history is unpublished\"],\"focusTrack\":\"destructive-history-recovery\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Skill\",\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".opencode/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md:309-330,482-500\",\".opencode/skills/sk-git/references/shared-patterns.md:156-210\",\".opencode/skills/sk-git/references/finish-workflows.md:258... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":3,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Investigate staging and commit semantics and distinguish intentional multi-path work from cross-session contamination\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"newInfoRatio\":0.72,\"noveltyJustification\":\"4 of 9 findings were fully new and 5 were partially new extensions or validations, yielding (4 + 0.5*5)/9 = 0.72 rounded.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which repository, worktree, index, remote, config, and account state is genuinely available before each candidate command runs?\",\"Which high-cost failures beyond the five observed incidents warrant new advisory rules?\",\"How often would each candidate fire in real repository history, and what is the defensible noise threshold?\",\"Which dangerous-looking operations should remain silent because enforcement already owns them or preflight state is unavailable or too noisy?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which staging and commit predicates detect objective selection mismatches without claiming unknowable cross-session ownership?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Path-count-only or cross-top-level warnings\",\"Unconditional commit --only/path-argument warnings\",\"Generic commit --include warnings\",\"Predicting interactive or stdin-generated path selections\",\"Treating inferred rename identity or pre-hook candidate trees as guaranteed final facts\"],\"focusTrack\":\"staging-commit-semantics\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Skill\",\"Read\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\",\"WebFetch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".opencode/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md:309-340\",\".opencode/skills/sk-git/references/commit-workflows.md:120-269,288-305\",\".opencode/scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit:1-118\",\".opencode/hooks/pre-commit:1-58\",\".opencode/scripts/git-hooks/commit-msg:1-186\",\".opencode/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-opencode/scripts/lib/dispatch-rule-checks.mjs:1-127\",\"research/BRIEFING.md:1-59\",\"htt... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"run\":4,\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Investigate worktree, remote, and account coordination and exact preflight race/noise boundaries\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"newInfoRatio\":0.75,\"noveltyJustification\":\"5 of 10 findings were fully new and 5 were partially new refinements, yielding (5 + 0.5*5)/10 = 0.75.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"Which repository, worktree, index, remote, con