   {\n+      \"id\": \"f5-attention-budget\",\n+      \"iteration\": 5,\n+      \"text\": \"Shadow-mode targets are under 0.5 alerts per 100 eligible invocations per rule and under 2 per 100 aggregate, with hard ceilings of 1 and 3; emit one coalesced line at most.\"\n@@\n-    ,\"Treating gh identity, API permission, or network snapshots as remote outcome proof\"\n+    ,\"Treating gh identity, API permission, or network snapshots as remote outcome proof\"\n+    ,\"Network probes, full object scans, and all-worktree sweeps in the synchronous path\"\n+    ,\"Generic filter-rewrite name matching without a validated mutating predicate\"\n@@\n-    \"iterationsCompleted\": 4,\n-    \"openQuestions\": 1,\n-    \"resolvedQuestions\": 4,\n-    \"keyFindings\": 41,\n-    \"convergenceScore\": 0.75,\n-    \"coverageBySources\": {\"code\": 33, \"history\": 16, \"state\": 26, \"web\": 2, \"network\": 2}\n+    \"iterationsCompleted\": 5,\n+    \"openQuestions\": 0,\n+    \"resolvedQuestions\": 5,\n+    \"keyFindings\": 46,\n+    \"convergenceScore\": 0.8,\n+    \"coverageBySources\": {\"code\": 33, \"history\": 20, \"state\": 30, \"web\": 2, \"network\": 2, \"benchmark\": 13}\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json\n+++ /Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineag