ot own force/delete/mirror/prune or destructive multi-ref semantics; these require positive destination evidence and coalesced advisories.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"f5-final-matrix\",\n+      \"iteration\": 5,\n+      \"text\": \"Twenty-three exact command/state rules survive ranking; fourteen broad, unavailable, enforcement-owned, or over-budget classes are rejected.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"id\": \"f5-attention-budget\",\n+      \"iteration\": 5,\n+      \"text\": \"Shadow-mode targets are under 0.5 alerts per 100 eligible invocations per rule and under 2 per 100 aggregate, with hard ceilings of 1 and 3; emit one coalesced line at most.\"\n     }\n   ],\n   \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n     \"Unconditional warnings for generic commit, reset, rebase, pull, or push\",\n@@ -98,14 +117,16 @@\n     ,\"Predicting interactive or stdin path selections and hook-time final commit state\"\n     ,\"Generic push, account, detached-worktree, and nondestructive multi-ref warnings\"\n     ,\"Duplicating pre-push naming and permission blockers\"\n     ,\"Treating gh identity, API permission, or network snapshots as remote outcome proof\"\n+    ,\"Network probes, full object scans, and all-worktree sweeps in the synchronous path\"\n+    ,\"Generic filter-rewrite name matching without a validated mutating predicate\"\n   ],\n   \"metrics\": {\n-    \"iterationsCompleted\": 4,\n-    \"openQuestions\": 1,\n-    \"resolvedQuestions\": 4,\n-    \"keyFindings\": 41,\n-    \"convergenceScore\": 0.75,\n-    \"coverageBySources\": {\"code\": 33, \"history\": 16, \"state\": 26, \"web\": 2, \"network\": 2}\n+    \"iterationsCompleted\": 5,\n+    \"openQuestions\": 0,\n+    \"resolvedQuestions\": 5,\n+    \"keyFindings\": 46,\n+    \"convergenceScore\": 0.8,\n+    \"coverageBySources\": {\"code\": 33, \"history\": 20, \"state\": 30, \"web\": 2, \"network\": 2, \"benchmark\": 13}\n   }\n }\n","additions":31,"deletions":10}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM .opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json","time":{"start":1785181655503,"end":1785181655511}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_05132d63891338b0016a67b5c7e44081918598a10ecf23444a"}},"id":"prt_fa51e14f2001AZloVzt9gat1YC","sessionID":"ses_05b144ddbffeTP8bqXDQv88HuN","messageID":"msg_fa51e057c001CWqlnZ8z9Hhst7"}}
