 already owned by pre-push enforcement\",\"Network probes, full object scans, and all-worktree sweeps in the synchronous hot path\",\"Generic filter-branch or filter-repo warnings without a validated exact mutating predicate\"],\"focusTrack\":\"noise-calibration-final-matrix\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Skill\",\"Glob\",\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"ApplyPatch\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"research/BRIEFING.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/deep-research-config.json\",\"research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl\",\"research/lineages/sol/deep-research-strategy.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/findings-registry.json\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-001.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-002.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-003.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/iterations/iteration-004.md\",\"research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-001.jsonl\",\"research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\",\"research/lineages/sol/deltas/iter-003.jso... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"max_iterations_reached\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"run\":5,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"iterationCount\":5,\"minIterations\":3,\"qualityGuards\":{\"sourceDiversity\":true,\"focusAlignment\":true,\"noWeakSingleSource\":true},\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T19:41:12Z\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-sol-1785178337201-eaydo6\",\"generation\":1}\n{\"type\":\"event\",\"event\":\"synthesis_complete\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"totalIterations\":5,\"answeredCount\":5,\"totalQuestions\":5,\"stopReason\":\"maxIterationsReached\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-27T19:41:12Z\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-sol-1785178337201-eaydo6\",\"generation\":1}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":8,"totalLines":8,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/sk-git/016-git-action-advisory-hook/001-advisory-research/research/lineages/sol/deep-research-state.jsonl","time":{"start":1785181797026,"end":1785181797031}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_07bd5b9f22168819016a67b662a71c81918f